<LegalPage title="Shipping & Returns" updated="October 3, 2026" intro="Delivery times, returns, exchanges and digital downloads for store orders.">
  <h2>Processing and delivery</h2>
  <p>Prints, apparel and gifts are made to order. Orders are usually produced within 2 to 7 business days, then shipped. Delivery within the U.S. typically takes 3 to 8 business days after shipping; international orders can take 2 to 4 weeks. You'll get a confirmation email when you order and tracking details when it ships. Shipping costs are shown at checkout.</p>

  <h2>Damaged, defective or wrong items</h2>
  <p>If something arrives damaged, misprinted or isn't what you ordered, email <a href="mailto:john@thereyouarejesus.com">john@thereyouarejesus.com</a> within 30 days of delivery with your order email and a photo. We'll send a replacement or a full refund, at no cost to you.</p>

  <h2>Returns and exchanges</h2>
  <p>Because items are made just for you, we can't accept returns for change of mind. If a shirt doesn't fit, contact us within 30 days and we'll do our best to arrange an exchange for a different size; you may be asked to cover shipping for the exchange.</p>

  <h2>Digital downloads</h2>
  <p>Digital products are available to download right after payment, and a link is emailed to you. Because they're delivered instantly, they can't be returned. If a file won't open or is damaged, contact us and we'll fix it or refund you.</p>

  <h2>Lost packages and address errors</h2>
  <p>Please check your shipping address at checkout. If a package is lost in transit, contact us and we'll work with the carrier to resolve it. If a package is returned because of an incorrect address, we can reship it once the address is corrected; additional shipping may apply.</p>

  <h2>Cancellations</h2>
  <p>Orders go into production quickly. If you need to cancel, email us within 12 hours of ordering and we'll do our best to stop it.</p>

  <h2>Taxes and duties</h2>
  <p>Sales tax is added at checkout where it applies. International orders may be charged import duties or taxes by your country, which are the buyer's responsibility.</p>
</LegalPage>
